Modifications
-------------

This distribution contains modified copies of the works above. Section 5(a) of
GPL-3.0 requires a modified source file to carry prominent notices stating that
the file was changed and the date. Modifications are recorded as follows:

- A modified upstream file carries a `Modified: <date> — <what changed>` line in
  its header, or, where the file format makes a header impossible, an entry in
  `docs/licensing.md`.
- `docs/licensing.md` is the authoritative list of the files this project
  changed or added on top of an upstream release, kept with the pin it applies
  to.
- Every release tag names one commit whose tree contains the exact sources the
  published artifacts were built from.

Third-party dependencies keep their own licenses; the LICENSE file here does not
replace them.
